<title>USA: TABLE-AMREP Corp Q4 net rises after gain.</title>
<headline>TABLE-AMREP Corp Q4 net rises after gain.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended April 30,</p>
<p>						   1997		 1996</p>
<p> Revenues				$41,990,000	$40,526,000</p>
<p> Net income			   6,350,000(a)	    231,000</p>
<p> Net income per share		    0.86(a)		 0.03</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>  common shares outstanding	  7,369,000	  7,369,000</p>
<p>					  Twelve Months Ended April 30,</p>
<p>						    1997		1996</p>
<p> Revenues				146,389,000	161,802,000</p>
<p> Net income			   7,282,000(a)	  2,785,000</p>
<p> Net income per share		    0.99(a)		 0.38</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>  common shares outstanding	  7,369,000	  7,384,000</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Includes benefit in the amount of $6,250,000 to reflect settlement of 1984 through 1989 tax examinations.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
